{{!--
  An incident's custom fields marked "Include in Subscriber Notifications",
  in the fields' order, one DetailBoxField row each. Rows come from
  Common/Server/Utils/StatusPage/IncidentTemplateVariableBuilder (the
  customFieldRows variable), which leaves out fields with no value.

  `title` (the field's name) and `plainText` are plain text a project member
  typed, and are escaped here. `renderedHtml` goes into the raw slot: the
  builder fills it only with HTML it produced itself - a Rich text field's
  Markdown rendered by Markdown.convertToHTML (raw HTML escaped, only
  http, https and mailto links kept), a Long text field's escaped lines
  joined with <br/>, or a date and time in the status page's time zones.
--}}
{{#each customFieldRows}}
{{#if renderedHtml}}
{{> DetailBoxField title=title blockText=renderedHtml }}
{{else}}
{{> DetailBoxField title=title plainText=plainText }}
{{/if}}
{{/each}}
